'''Volume 62''' is the 62nd volume of the [[Pokémon Adventures]] manga. It is both the eighth and final volume in the {{MangaArc|X & Y}} and the first volume in the {{MangaArc|Omega Ruby & Alpha Sapphire}}. It is authored by [[Hidenori Kusaka]] and illustrated by [[Satoshi Yamamoto]].

In VIZ Media's English translation, this volume is published as volume one of a separately numbered series, "Pokémon Adventures: Omega Ruby and Alpha Sapphire".

==Blurb==
<i>While training with Sapphire and their friend Steven in Sea Mauville, Emerald is attacked by a mystery Pokémon! Meanwhile, Ruby journeys to the Sky Pillar to earn the trust of Zinnia, the Lorekeeper of the reclusive Draconid tribe.

Can three Hoenn Pokédex holders stop a crisis of epic magnitude?</i>

